  _headline: Parque enche na chuva e o bairro fica seco
  _headlineEn: Park fills up in the rain, and the neighborhood stays dry
  _body: "O lago sobe na tempestade e guarda a \xE1gua que ia para as ruas. No sol,
    J\xFAlia leva a turma para estudar as capivaras."
  _bodyEn: "The lake rises in the storm and holds water bound for the streets. On
    sunny days, J\xFAlia takes her class to study the capybaras."
